{
  "description": "core §7.5, a collection's digest. Written by an independent reading of the text (Python, standard library), checked, never blessed. `cases`: the collection's live members, each its base-relative `key`, its stamp's `run_width` (16 or 32), `run` and `seq` → each member's `values` (the first 4 bytes of the sha256 of the key in UTF-8, a zero byte, a byte holding the run's width bit, 0 for 16 and 1 for 32, then the run and the seq big-endian, as an envelope writes them), in the order given, and the `digest`: their XOR, 0 with none live, as 8 hex digits.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "note": "none live: 0",
      "members": [],
      "expect": {
        "values": [],
        "digest": "00000000"
      }
    },
    {
      "note": "one member, a 16-bit run",
      "members": [
        {
          "key": "zk2/lab/n1/hb.v1/state/link",
          "run_width": 16,
          "run": 1,
          "seq": 7
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "values": [
          "5c0c752c"
        ],
        "digest": "5c0c752c"
      }
    },
    {
      "note": "the same key and seq under a 32-bit run of the same value: another value",
      "members": [
        {
          "key": "zk2/lab/n1/hb.v1/state/link",
          "run_width": 32,
          "run": 1,
          "seq": 7
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "values": [
          "a41dc20c"
        ],
        "digest": "a41dc20c"
      }
    },
    {
      "note": "the same member one seq later",
      "members": [
        {
          "key": "zk2/lab/n1/hb.v1/state/link",
          "run_width": 16,
          "run": 1,
          "seq": 8
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "values": [
          "3570a90f"
        ],
        "digest": "3570a90f"
      }
    },
    {
      "note": "the same member, another run",
      "members": [
        {
          "key": "zk2/lab/n1/hb.v1/state/link",
          "run_width": 16,
          "run": 2,
          "seq": 7
        }
      ],
      "expect": {
        "values": [
          "208c03c2"
        ],
        "digest": "208c03c2"
      }
    },
    {
